  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOR THE CONSORTIUM&#x2019;S SUPPORT OF VULNERABLE COMMUNITIES IN THE WEST BANK TO COVER THE PERIOD FROM 1 JANUARY 2023 &#x2013; MARCH 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WBPC has developed an integrated programme response to address the wide range of humanitarian vulnerabilitiesand protection threats that trigger forcible transfer in the West Bank context. The Consortium ensures coordination withother actors in the provision of humanitarian assistance &#x2013; at policy, technical and operational levels - and is now widelyrecognised for its centrality within the humanitarian architecture in the West Bank.</narrative>
